"""Project-local tools.

Any function decorated with @ep_tool in this directory is auto-discovered on
startup via [platform.extensions] = [..., "./extensions"] in the project config.
The returned string is what the agent sees as the tool result.

Nothing is registered yet, on purpose — a new project should not be born with a
tool its agent can call but nobody asked for. Uncomment the example below, or
write your own, then restart the gateway.
"""

